<title>UK: UK's ProServ merges with Marquee - paper.</title>
<headline>UK's ProServ merges with Marquee - paper.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>ProServ, the UK sports marketing group has merged with Marquee Group Inc of the U.S., creating the second largest sports marketing company, the Times said on Monday.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The newspaper said the merger is part of the consolidation in the sports marketing business. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
